ies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Issue description\r\nWith our adTagUrl (VMAP) every first ad in AdGroup is getting timeout. When I revert this commit: https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/commit/fe754f313e8ddba5a77f149ee23f0082c1c2fea6 everything is working fine. I've emailed our adTagUrl to dev.exoplayer@gmail.com.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction steps\r\nJust switch \"ad_tag_uri\" in media.exolist.json to our custom adTagUrl and play.\r\n\r\n### Link to test content\r\nOur custom adTagUrl has been sent to dev.exoplayer@gmail.com.\r\n\r\n### A full bug report captured from the device\r\n```\r\nI/ImaAdsLoader: AdEvent: {errorMessage=VAST media file loading reached a timeout of 8 seconds., errorCode=402, type=adPlayError}\r\n```\r\n\r\n###  Version of ExoPlayer being used\r\n2.12.3\r\n\r\n### Device(s) and version(s) of Android being used\r\nHuawei P30 Pro, Android 10.0\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/8492/rea